---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftRestorationFinding
---
Construct a RestorationFinding draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Recheck the affected user-visible functions and representative cohorts after recovery actions. Distinguish reduced alerts from actual restoration, retain residual degradation, and schedule observation long enough to detect recurrence under the supplied incident policy.
